@JwtCourseApiBasic_HostAddress = https://localhost:7123
@token = paste-login-access-token-here

### 公開 API
GET {{JwtCourseApiBasic_HostAddress}}/api/demo/public
Accept: application/json

###
# 登入：複製 response 中的 accessToken，貼到上方 @token
POST {{JwtCourseApiBasic_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "student",
  "password": "Student123!"
}

### 需要登入
GET {{JwtCourseApiBasic_HostAddress}}/api/demo/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Student 會得到 403；改用 admin token 可得到 200
GET {{JwtCourseApiBasic_HostAddress}}/api/demo/admin
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### student 會得到 200；admin 會得到 403
GET {{JwtCourseApiBasic_HostAddress}}/api/demo/it-department
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
